            "review_title": "Review at Pizza 4P's Vincom Grand Park",
            "review_text": "Yuri Sng\nSingapore, Singapore11 contributions\n0\nWhat an amazing meal at Pizza 4P's!\nDec 2025 • Family\nThis is the 3rd time to this amazing restaurant. From the appetiser, to the main course & dessert, it was simply delicious. The service staff is attentive & courteous. Highly recommended.\nWritten December 3, 2025\nPizza 4P's Guest Service\nDear Mr./Ms. Seaside10088898513,\n\nThank you so much for visiting Pizza 4P's again and for sharing such a wonderful review at Pizza 4P's Vincome Grand Park. We are truly delighted to know that this was already your third visit and that you enjoyed everything from the appetizer to the main course and dessert.\n\nYour kind words about our attentive and courteous service team mean a lot to us. They will be a great motivation for us to continue delivering the best dining experience to all our guests.\n\nWe sincerely appreciate your recommendation and look forward to welcoming you back for many more delicious meals at Pizza 4P's.\n\nWarm regards,\nPizza 4P's Team\nRead more\nWritten December 4, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
