            "review_title": "Review at Pizza 4P's Vincom Grand Park",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n23\n4P’s Vincom Grand Park for simply delicious pizzas in District 9\nDec 2024 • Solo\nI dropped in here today by myself for a very late lunch. I chose 4P’s because they are so reliable wherever you eat at them across Vietnam. They simply make the best Pizzas. Sure enough this 4P’s did not disappoint. \n\nSuper friendly service, and absolutely delicious food from the organic salad to the Pizza. \n\nA special mention to Kloey, who really looked after me and sorted out a slight confusion with the Pizza order that had resulted in a short delay. A big thank you for the complimentary yogurt dessert which was so refreshing, it too was delicious and I will order it next time.\nRead more\nWritten December 22, 2024\nPizza 4P's Guest Service\nDear Mr./Ms. AnhArmaan,\n\nThank you for taking the time to share your recent experience at Pizza 4P’s Vincom Grand Park. \n\nYour compliments on the quality of our food, from the organic salad to the pizza, are deeply appreciated. It’s always a pleasure to hear from guests who recognize the effort we put into crafting delicious and memorable meals.\n\nWe are especially grateful for your kind mention of our staff. Knowing that they provided attentive and friendly service while resolving the slight delay in your order is heartening. Your words of appreciation will be shared with the team as encouragement to continue delivering exceptional hospitality.\n\nWe’re also thrilled that you enjoyed the complimentary yogurt dessert and found it refreshing. Your feedback inspires us to keep innovating and delivering \"WOW\" moments for our guests.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back soon and hope to serve you more delicious meals and desserts in the future. \n\nWishing you a wonderful day ahead!\n\nWarm regards,\nPizza 4P’s Team\nRead more\nWritten December 25, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
